      "writtenOn": "2026-11-23T20:54:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "TokenAccumulator still coalesces consecutive OPERATOR tokens, merging adjacent Lean operators like `⟨⟩`, `⟨⟨a, b⟩⟩`, `¬∃`, `¬∀`, `¬¬p`, `λ⟨x, y⟩`, or `:\u003d¬` into multi-character strings. Because `isUnicodeOperator` (via `LeanSyntax.UNICODE_OPERATORS`) only matches single-character strings, merged tokens return `false` and lose Unicode operator styling in `LeanHtml.tokenClass` (in changes 658566 and 658568). Skipping coalescing when `kind \u003d\u003d LeanTokenKind.OPERATOR` (or emitting Unicode operators unmerged) keeps every Unicode operator standalone; please also add an adjacent-operator case in `LeanHighlighterTest`.",
